model g5
  tally 2
  on 2025-01-01
  start 2025-01-01
  end 2025-03-31
unit DUK: currency minor 0.01
kind pays: event certain
  leg cash: DUK
place konto: accounts DUK lives 2025-01-01..
place world: outside lives 2025-01-01..
move pay[m in months]: pays
  on end_of(m) - 1 day
  when bal(konto) > 0 or pos(m) > 1
  reads konto
  leg cash from world to konto amount 1
move fee[m in months]: transfers
  on next(pays, start_of(m)).day
  leg cash from world to konto amount 1
ask q: bal(konto, 2025-03-31)
